    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Trop longtemps s\u00e9par\u00e9e de son fr\u00e8re, Alice se rend sur ses traces au Japon, dans un village hors du temps, au pied des falaises. Ici, Nathan avait retrouv\u00e9 l'apaisement aupr\u00e8s d'un certain Da\u00efsuke. C'est au tour d'Alice de se rapprocher du vieil homme, et de ses h\u00f4tes. Dans une atmosph\u00e8re toute japonaise, elle se remet \u00e0 \u00e9couter son coeur...",
        "english": "Alice has been separated from her brother, Nathan, for too long. After he dies, Alice leaves for Japan and finds refuge in a small village by the cliffs. Nathan said he had found peace there, thanks to a man called Daisuke. As she follows in her brother\u2019s footsteps, she too becomes close with the elderly man and with his other guests. In a particularly Japanese atmosphere, she starts to listen to her own heart once again."
